7. The points that arise for my consideration are;
1. Whether the prosecution proves beyond all reasonable doubt that the accused No.1 was married with CW.1 on 31.08.2007 and thereafter, the accused No.1 along with accused No.2 to 4 with a common intention have subjected CW.1 to cruelty by harassing her both by physically and mentally and thereby committed an offence punishable U/s.498A R/w Sec.34 of IPC ?
2. Whether the prosecution proves beyond all in furtherance of common intention have C.C.No.53622/2018 abused CW.1 in filthy language and thereby committed an offence punishable U/s.504 R/w 34 of IPC ?
